<title>OMAN: Oman 1995 budget deficit is 9.1 percent of GDP.</title>
<headline>Oman 1995 budget deficit is 9.1 percent of GDP.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Central Bank said in its annual report that the budget deficit for 1995 dropped slightly to 9.1 percent of GDP at current prices. The report was carried by the official Omani news agency.</p>
<p>Detailed figures in millions of rials:</p>
<p>				    1995	     1994</p>
<p> Budget deficit		-479.4	   -495.5</p>
<p> Government revenue	 1,851.6	  1,757.4</p>
<p>($1=0.38 rials)</p>
</text>
